00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.300
What?!

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:19.470
I-I didn't even realize it! Um...

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:22.260
Don't straighten the rod
vertically too much, or it'll break.

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:24.050
O-Okay.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:27.520
Okay, it's dangerous,
so don't put your finger on the line.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:34.650
I can see it!

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:37.820
I'll scoop it up with a net,
so keep it up just a little longer!

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.450
And we got it!

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:47.540
I caught one!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:51.870
Here. Now you can hold it.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:02.470
