to see me in that state?

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.410
I am happy though.

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:57.250
I can just picture how
ecstatic the runts will be.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:00.290
Jeez, you're such a parent.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:03.920
By the way, have you two
ever filleted a dorado?

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:04.920
I haven't.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:06.970
