00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:13.520
"Scombroid fish poisoning"

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:15.100
"Scombroid fish poisoning"
"Vibrio parahaemolyticus"

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:19.600
